(   [Problem Statement]: Analyze a space tripod structure supported on three ball joints subjected to a vertical load W and horizontal load H at apex A.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Structural Context & Equilibrium Classification:) Tj
T*
(   This analysis addresses internal member forces and structural determinacy for plane truss) Tj
T*
(   systems.) Tj
T*
(   Governing criteria: All joints are frictionless spherical pins; loads act exclusively at nodes;) Tj
T*
(   members are ideal two-force axial elements carrying pure tension \(+T\) or compression \(-C\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Mathematical Derivation & Step-by-Step Joint/Section Analysis:) Tj
T*
(   Spatial Equilibrium of a Three-Legged Tripod:) Tj
T*
(   1. Vector Formulation of Member Forces:) Tj
T*
(   Let apex A have coordinates \(0, 0, h\).) Tj
T*
(   Let foundation support joints have coordinates: B\(xB, yB, 0\), C\(xC, yC, 0\), D\(xD, yD, 0\).) Tj
T*
(   Position vectors from apex to ground:) Tj
T*
(   r_AB = xB*i + yB*j - h*k; |r_AB| = L1; lambda_AB = r_AB / L1.) Tj
T*
(   r_AC = xC*i + yC*j - h*k; |r_AC| = L2; lambda_AC = r_AC / L2.) Tj
T*
(   r_AD = xD*i + yD*j - h*k; |r_AD| = L3; lambda_AD = r_AD / L3.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Equilibrium Equations at Apex A \(Sigma F = 0\):) Tj
T*
(   F_AB * lambda_AB + F_AC * lambda_AC + F_AD * lambda_AD + \( Hx*i + Hy*j - W*k \) = 0.) Tj
T*
(   Yields three simultaneous linear algebraic equations:) Tj
T*
(   - Sigma Fx = 0: F_AB * \(xB/L1\) + F_AC * \(xC/L2\) + F_AD * \(xD/L3\) + Hx = 0.) Tj
T*
(   - Sigma Fy = 0: F_AB * \(yB/L1\) + F_AC * \(yC/L2\) + F_AD * \(yD/L3\) + Hy = 0.) Tj
T*
(   - Sigma Fz = 0: - F_AB * \(h/L1\) - F_AC * \(h/L2\) - F_AD * \(h/L3\) - W = 0.) Tj
T*
(   3. Solution via Matrix Inversion or Cramer's Rule directly provides the compressive thrust in) Tj
T*
(   all three tripod legs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Structural Equilibrium & Kinematic Compatibility Check:) Tj
T*
(   - External determinacy verified via global equilibrium equations: Sigma Fx = 0, Sigma Fy = 0,) Tj
T*
(   Sigma M = 0.) Tj
T*
(   - Internal determinacy satisfied via Maxwell's criterion: m = 2*j - 3.) Tj
T*
(   - Joint node equilibrium confirmed: Vector resultant of all concurrent member forces vanishes) Tj
T*
(   at each pin.) Tj
T*
