T*
(   2. Mathematical Derivation & Step-by-Step Joint/Section Analysis:) Tj
T*
(   Tension Coefficient Method for Space Trusses:) Tj
T*
(   Let t_AB = T_AB / L_AB be the tension coefficient of member AB \(force per unit length\).) Tj
T*
(   1. Component Equations:) Tj
T*
(   Tx = t_AB * \(xB - xA\), Ty = t_AB * \(yB - yA\), Tz = t_AB * \(zB - zA\).) Tj
T*
(   2. Joint Equilibrium:) Tj
T*
(   Sigma t_AB * \(xB - xA\) + X_A = 0; Sigma t_AB * \(yB - yA\) + Y_A = 0; Sigma t_AB * \(zB - zA\) +) Tj
T*
(   Z_A = 0.) Tj
T*
(   Forms linear equations without trigonometric functions, ideal for computational matrix solving.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Structural Equilibrium & Kinematic Compatibility Check:) Tj
T*
(   - External determinacy verified via global equilibrium equations: Sigma Fx = 0, Sigma Fy = 0,) Tj
T*
(   Sigma M = 0.) Tj
T*
(   - Internal determinacy satisfied via Maxwell's criterion: m = 2*j - 3.) Tj
T*
(   - Joint node equilibrium confirmed: Vector resultant of all concurrent member forces vanishes) Tj
T*
(   at each pin.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Civil Engineering Design & Stability Implications:) Tj
T*
(   Compression members must be checked for Euler column buckling \(P_cr = pi^2 * E * I / L_eff^2\),) Tj
T*
(   while tension members are governed by net cross-sectional yield strength under bridge/roof) Tj
T*
(   design standards.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
