T*
(   Thermal Stresses in Trusses:) Tj
T*
(   1. Statically Determinate Trusses:) Tj
T*
(   Members expand or contract freely by delta L = alpha * L * Delta T.) Tj
T*
(   Joints displace geometrically without developing ANY internal thermal forces \(Thermal stress =) Tj
T*
(   0\).) Tj
T*
(   2. Statically Indeterminate Trusses:) Tj
T*
(   Redundant members restrain free thermal expansion, inducing massive internal thermal stresses) Tj
T*
(   and forces.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Structural Equilibrium & Kinematic Compatibility Check:) Tj
T*
(   - External determinacy verified via global equilibrium equations: Sigma Fx = 0, Sigma Fy = 0,) Tj
