T*
(   Transmission Line Tower Space Trusses:) Tj
T*
(   1. Loading Cases: Dead weight of cables, transverse wind pressure on conductors, longitudinal) Tj
T*
(   torsional shock load from broken conductor wires.) Tj
T*
(   2. Structure: 4-legged tapered space truss with diagonal cross-bracing designed using the) Tj
T*
(   tension-coefficient method.) Tj
T*
() Tj
