T*
(   Earthquake Lateral Force on Towers:) Tj
T*
(   Base shear induces lateral storey drifts.) Tj
T*
(   Cross-bracing diagonals resist lateral shear via tension-compression couples: F_brace =) Tj
T*
(   V_storey / cos\(theta\).) Tj
T*
(   Chords resist the accumulated overturning cantilever moment: F_chord = M_overturn / Base_width.) Tj
T*
() Tj
