T*
(   Vierendeel Truss Characteristics:) Tj
T*
(   A framework with rectangular openings and NO diagonal members.) Tj
T*
(   Stability is achieved ENTIRELY through rigid, moment-resisting corner joints. Members carry) Tj
T*
(   high bending moments and shears; it is a rigid frame, not an ideal pin-jointed truss.) Tj
